Encoding: UTF-8
Maintainer: Gael Millot <gael.millot@pasteur.fr>
Description: Functions that check the code of R functions according to the recommendations of the 'safer-r' project (see <https://github.com/safer-r>), and correct it when possible: no super-assignment, standard function() writing of lambda functions, package names before the called functions (like base::mean()), complete writing of the arguments of the calls, curly brackets around the bodies of if/else, for, while, repeat and function constructs, TRUE and FALSE written in full, and controlled for() loop sequences. The corrected function is returned or written into a file. Other functions check argument values, check that packages and functions are installed, detect object names also present in the calling environments and the search path, catch the errors, warnings and messages of instructions, and write log files.
URL: https://github.com/safer-r/saferDev, https://safer-r.github.io/saferDev/
BugReports: https://github.com/safer-r/saferDev/issues
License: GPL-3
